      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استبذلهُ</span></b>  <i>He sought,</i> or <i>demanded, of him a
liberal, free,</i> or <i>willing, gift.</i> (TA.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِسْتَبْذَلْتُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلَانًا شَيْئًا</span> <i>I asked of such a one that he would
liberally, freely,</i> or <i>willingly, give me a thing.</i> (T.)

